    "verification": "Account automatically identified by SSH-key fingerprint (no email/password signup). Prepaid $10 minimum via Paddle; no card stored by Shellbox.",
    "tiers": "16 running x1-equivalent slots and 64 total slots/user; an xN box uses N slots. No documented paid quota ladder.",
    "notes": "16-machine upper bound applies ONLY to smallest x1 (2 vCPU/4 GB); derived vCPU pool 16×2=32. A 4 vCPU/8 GB box consumes 2 slots, permitting only 8 running. 10 such machines or 50/300/1,000 any-size exceed defaults; raise procedure and timing unpublished.",
